-1", "storyline": "Chaos Zero Nightmare: Command agents aboard the SS Nightmare through unpredictable roguelike Chaos runs in a sci-fi world devoured by cosmic horror\u2014build unique decks from character-specific cards, chase wild synergies to break enemies, and manage mounting stress to dodge mental breakdowns that trigger Deep Trauma.\n\nBack at base, dive into moving Trauma Code stories revealing each agent's haunted past and personal fears, then hit the Epione Center for tense, choice-driven therapy sessions\u2014counsel them to reclaim corrupted save data and boost bonds, or erase memories for a quick reset (but lose those gains). Every failure hits hard but fuels deeper progression and replayability.", "summary": "Chaos Zero Nightmare is a cosmic loop RPG. The official has announced that Chaos Zero Nightmare will come to us soon. Some glimpses of character animations were shown in the teaser, evoking a similar 2D art and animation style to Epic Seven.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/chaos-zero-nightmare--1", "videos": [{"id": 154178, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "OReXVmXCYLo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OReXVmXCYLo", "title": "[Chaos Zero Nightmare] World Preview Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OReXVmXCYLo/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 154179, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "0nydDSWNwMA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0nydDSWNwMA", "title": "[Chaos Zero Nightmare] Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0nydDSWNwMA/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}